{"id":"633909","name":"酸甜萝卜","author":"笑笑昵","authorId":"10878013","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633909/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"泡椒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"白萝卜切成条。","img":"images/633909/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入盐翻拌均匀腌制二十分钟。","img":"images/633909/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"倒岀腌制岀来的水。","img":"images/633909/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用纯净水清洗一下捞岀。","img":"images/633909/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备干净的无油无生水的坛子，放入煮开晾凉的水。","img":"images/633909/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入白萝卜。","img":"images/633909/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入10克的盐。","img":"images/633909/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入150克的白糖。","img":"images/633909/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入120克的白醋。","img":"images/633909/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入泡椒用干净无油的筷子搅拌一下。","img":"images/633909/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盖紧盖子放置三到五天即可。","img":"images/633909/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/633909/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}